{%- comment -%}
  won-promo-config — the only bridge between the theme and won-promo-code.js.

  POC scope: a single promo identifier written as a private line-item property
  that an AUTOMATIC Shopify Discount Function matches on. The identifier is NOT
  a Shopify discount code and is never redeemed through /discount/<code>.

  Rendered only where the native discount field exists (`show_add_discount_code`),
  because the script takes that field over rather than adding one — with the
  field switched off there is nothing to take over, and won-promo-code.js stays
  inert without this element.

  Texts live in locales so a merchant can reword them in the language editor.
  The identifier itself deliberately does NOT: it has to match the Function's
  line-group condition exactly, and a merchant editing it in the language editor
  would silently break the match with no feedback anywhere.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if settings.show_add_discount_code -%}
  <div
    data-won-promo
    data-code="tomii_smolka_35"
    data-invalid="{{ 'won.promo.invalid' | t | escape }}"
    data-failed="{{ 'won.promo.failed' | t | escape }}"
    data-applied="{{ 'won.promo.applied' | t | escape }}"
    data-remove="{{ 'won.promo.remove' | t | escape }}"
    hidden
  ></div>
{%- endif -%}
